    },
    {
      "example_num": 2,
      "example_text": "Input: croakOfFrogs = \"crcoakroak\"\nOutput: 2 \nExplanation: The minimum number of frogs is two. \nThe first frog could yell \"crcoakroak\".\nThe second frog could yell later \"crcoakroak\".",
